From be8adea3f72434076756a8117cc902d7ac04ff77 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@example.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 06:09:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Patch 11: full-screen viewer with zoom, swipe, video playback
 and details

- Viewer route opened from the grid, paged over the same newest-first list (swipe between items)
- Pinch / double-tap zoom with pan limits; edge drags hand back to the pager
- Sharp image layered over the instant system thumbnail; video playback via Media3
- Tap toggles chrome and immersive mode; Share action
- Details sheet: file info plus EXIF (camera, exposure, ISO, focal length, GPS)
- Bottom bar hidden in the viewer; repository tracks every live paging source
- Thumbnail fetcher skips large requests so the viewer gets real pixels
